  β Σδ(yY) / yY        -0.0001  +0.0125  +0.0066   -0.0004   +0.0046
    2βΣ Y_l u_l        -0.0001  +0.0129  +0.0069   -0.0006   +0.0054   (identity: equal in mean)
    own-skew part T    +0.0000  +0.0005  +0.0030   +0.0038   +0.0058
    partner part J     -0.0001  +0.0166  +0.0029   -0.0032   -0.0024
  β ΣδH / |H|          +0.0007  +0.0075  +0.0729   +0.0222   +0.0068
  β ΣδK / |K|          +0.0004  -0.0044  +0.0153   +0.0500   -0.0150
  β ΣδT / |C|          -0.0001  -0.1385  -0.0857   -0.0379   -0.0332
